title: Dashboard › Request drawer › Answer a payer information request
route: /dashboard?request=P-1499
intro: When a payer asks for more information, Packet drafts the answer from the chart, Integrity checks it, and a person reads it and signs. Nothing leaves before the signature. In the demo the payer's ask is seeded or triggered by a Demo control, and the send is simulated.
dir: TD
also: Real world: an information request is tracked, and a clinical supplement passes the clinician sign-off gate before it goes out. Demo only: one click on 'Sign and send answer' stands in for that, and the send is simulated.
---
start s0 "A payer wants more information on a request"
ext x1 "Payer asks for more information\nthrough its portal, fax or phone (demo: seeded for P-1499, or the Demo control 'Asks for information')"
agent a1 "Packet drafts the answer from the chart\nIntegrity checks every sentence against it"
store w1 "Request becomes Info requested (amber)\nNeeds you; next step 'Packet drafted the answer. Waiting for your review'"
toast t1 "Notification 'Payer asked for info'\n'Harborview MA wants more on P-1499. Packet drafted the answer.'"
screen sc "Dashboard\n'Info requested' tile goes up and the sidebar Dashboard badge counts it\nThe row floats to the top: it needs you"

start s1 "Click the row, or the notification, then the amber box 'Needs your input'"
click c1 "Click 'Review the answer'"
overlay o1 "Pop-up 'Packet's answer for P-1499'\n'Harborview MA asked for more information · PHP'\nDrafted by Packet and checked by Integrity"

group gModal "Inside the pop-up, from the top down"
  screen m1 "'What the payer asked for'\nNumbered list of the items asked"
  decision d1 "Which program is the request for?"
  doc r1 "Residential 3.5\nLast 14 days of therapy notes, ASAM ratings, medication changes, step-down plan"
  doc r2 "PHP\nDaily attendance for 10 program days, latest psychiatric note, depression and anxiety scores, step-down plan to IOP"
  doc r3 "IOP\nAttendance for 4 weeks, urine screens, scale scores, work or school schedule"
  doc r4 "Detox\nWithdrawal scores for 72 hours, vital signs and medication, plan for the next level of care"
  doc m2 "'The drafted answer'\nOne paragraph per item, each pointing to an entry in the chart, then a closing line"
  doc m3 "'Attached from the chart'\nFile names with page counts"
  toast m4 "'Integrity checked every sentence against the chart'\n'4 of 4 checks passed. Navigator sends the answer through the payer's portal as soon as you sign. Nothing leaves before then.'"
endgroup

decision d2 "Does the person send it?"
click c2 "Click 'Not yet'"
click c3 "Click the X, click the dimmed area, or press Escape"
process p0 "Pop-up closes\nThe request is unchanged and still needs you"
process p1 "Escape also closes the drawer behind the pop-up"
end e1 "Back to the drawer or the table\nStill 'Needs your input'"

click c4 "Click 'Sign and send answer'"
process p2 "Pop-up closes"
store w2 "Request becomes Under review\nNo longer needs you; Navigator holds it; next step 'Navigator checks again in 30 minutes'"
store w3 "History gets 'You reviewed the answer and sent it' and 'Navigator sent the answer through the payer's portal'\nand a dashed 'Navigator checks again'"
toast t2 "'Answer sent'\n'P-1499 is back under review.'"
ext x2 "Payer receives the answer (demo: simulated)"
wait wt "Payer reviews again"
end e2 "Drawer shows Under review\nBanner: 'Next automatic check in 30 minutes.'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Demo controls: the payer answers"

s0 --> x1 --> a1 --> w1 --> t1 --> sc
s1 --> c1 --> o1 --> m1 --> d1
d1 -->|Residential 3.5| r1 --> m2
d1 -->|PHP| r2 --> m2
d1 -->|IOP| r3 --> m2
d1 -->|Detox| r4 --> m2
m2 --> m3 --> m4 --> d2
d2 -->|No, not yet| c2 --> p0
d2 -->|No, close it| c3 --> p0
c3 -.-> p1
p0 --> e1
d2 -->|Yes| c4 --> p2 --> w2 --> w3 --> t2 --> x2 --> wt --> e2
wt -.-> g1
sc -.-> s1
